OL,3,AFaisal Islam: The two big calls the
OL,4,Achancellor has to make ahead of the
OL,5,ABudget
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It is tough," John Healey admitted to
OL,8,Fme earlier this month when I asked him
OL,9,Fif there had been too much
OL,10,Fdoom-mongering?
OL,12,F"Conflicts, uncertainty, driving up
OL,13,Finflation, driving up interest rates.
OL,14,FBut we've got great strengths. We've
OL,15,Fgot good reasons to be confident about
OL,16,Fthe future of Britain," he insisted.
OL,18,FThe new scheme to try and help young
OL,19,Fpeople get on the property ladder,
OL,20,Fannounced on Saturday, was aimed at
OL,21,Fboosting confidence in the economy.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
